<title>USA: Mystique Dev names new directors.</title>
<headline>Mystique Dev names new directors.</headline>
<dateline>REDONDO BEACH, Calif. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mystique Developments Inc Tuesday said all of its previous officers and directors had resigned and the new officers and directors are Kim Fuerst, President and Director, Faisal Chaudhary, Secretary and Director and J. Samuel Butler, Director.</p>
